{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":68,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["得勝的凱歌"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛作的詩歌，交給樂長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"願上帝起來驅散祂的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使恨祂的人四散奔逃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你驅散他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如風把煙吹散。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願惡人在上帝面前滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如蠟在火中熔化。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願義人在上帝面前歡欣快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們高興歡喜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要歌頌上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讚美祂的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要頌揚乘駕雲彩的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的名字是耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在祂面前歡喜快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在聖所的上帝是孤兒的父親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寡婦的保護者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使孤苦者有家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓被囚者歡然脫離牢籠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但叛逆者要住在乾旱之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾帶領你的子民走過曠野。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，在西奈山的上帝面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在以色列的上帝面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地震動，諸天降雨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，你降下沛雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滋潤你乾旱的產業以色列，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓你的子民得以安居在那裡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你滿懷恩慈地供養窮苦人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主下達命令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成群的婦女便奔走相告：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「眾王和他們的軍隊逃走了，逃走了！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家中的婦女都在分戰利品。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使躺在羊圈裡的人也披金戴銀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像鴿子鍍銀的翅膀和金光閃閃的羽毛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能的上帝驅散了眾王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勢如大雪灑落在撒們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的山巍峨雄壯，群峰聳立。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"崇山峻嶺啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為何嫉妒地盯著上帝選為居所的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華永遠居住的地方呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝帶著千千萬萬的戰車從西奈山來到祂的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你升上高天時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶著許多俘虜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你接受了眾人的禮物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至叛逆者的禮物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華上帝就住在那裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要稱頌主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"稱頌我們的救主上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂天天背負我們的重擔。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"我們的上帝是拯救的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華救我們脫離死亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝必打碎仇敵的頭顱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敲破怙惡不悛者的腦袋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要把他們從巴珊帶回來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從深海帶回來，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓你們的腳從他們的血泊中踩過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的狗也可以舔他們的血。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，你的隊伍已經出現；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝，我的王啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的隊伍進了聖所，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌唱的在前，奏樂的殿後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搖手鼓的少女居中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要在大會中讚美上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的會眾都要讚美耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最小的便雅憫支派在前領路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"後面跟著大群的猶大首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"還有西布倫和拿弗他利的首領。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你施展你的權能；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你像以前一樣為我們彰顯你的力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因著你耶路撒冷的聖殿，君王都帶禮物來獻給你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你斥責那蘆葦中的野獸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斥責成群的公牛和列邦的牛犢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們俯首獻上貢銀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你驅散好戰的列邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的使節來朝見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實也要歸降上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世上的列國啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要向上帝歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要歌頌主，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌頌淩駕在萬古穹蒼之上的主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽啊，祂聲如雷鳴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要傳揚上帝的大能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的威榮普照以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的權能彰顯於穹蒼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，你在聖所中令人敬畏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的上帝把力量和權能賜給祂的子民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝當受稱頌！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/68.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/69.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/67.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":35}